{comment: Verse 1}
On a [A]hill far away stood an [Dmaj7]old rugged cross
The [E7]emblem of suffering and [A]shame
And I [A]love that old cross where the [Dmaj7]dearest and best
For a [E7]world of lost [A]sinners was slain

{comment: Chorus}
